1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
조용한 밤인데 마음은 왜 시끄러울까요.
The quietest hour of the day, and my mind is so loud.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,986
앤 모로 린드버그는 말했어요.
Anne Morrow Lindbergh wrote,

3
00:00:07,086 --> 00:00:13,057
바닷가처럼 비워 두고 아무것도 고르지 말라고.
"One should lie empty, open, choiceless as a beach—
waiting for a gift from the sea."

4
00:00:13,157 --> 00:00:18,400
고르기만 하던 하루 끝, 불 꺼진 거실.
The dark living room of someone who spent all evening choosing.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,500
그 멍한 시간은 비워 내는 중일지도요.
Maybe that blank time is emptying out.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오늘의 선택은 다 끝났어요.
Today's choices are all done.
